==Battleground==
*1 [[Sunfish Jones]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*3 [[Dober P.D]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Wall Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Because of the Dober P.Ds, you should bring [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] to block their waves. For the Sunfish Jones, just spam some high DPS cats like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] or [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], decent meatshields and tankers such as [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]], and the aforementioned Octopus. An alternative strategy is to push the Dobers using [[Lone Cat and Kitten (Rare Cat)|Tourist Cat]] and [[Glass Cat (Rare Cat)|Glass Cat]], rushing the Sunfish and the base.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*Any [[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|anti-Traitless Cats]] that can expedite Dober P.D's inevitable demise. Examples include [[Ninja Girl Tomoe (Uber Rare Cat)|Gourmand Ninja Girl Tomoe]] and [[Issun Boshi (Uber Rare Cat)|Oni Landshaker Kozuchimaru]].

